# "Activate only if you control three or more artifacts" (CR 602.5b): with two Moxen the search ability is refused (an
# option that is offered but unaffordable would still count, so the refusal is the condition), and with four Moxen it is
# offered. The search is for an artifact card, which a player may fail to find (CR 701.23b): Bot1 takes none although Sol
# Ring is in the library, the Fair is sacrificed as a cost all the same, and nothing is added to the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Inventors' Fair
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Island x2
Sol Ring
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Inventors' Fair.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Inventors' Fair.Activate(Ability: Search)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Inventors' Fair.Activate(Ability: Search)
Bot1.Search()

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Inventors' Fair
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
